  "query_preview": "Forecast Discussion...\n\nOverall, not much change was noted in the recent model guidance for \nthe extended forecast period.  A progressive flow pattern will \nremain in place across North America with a rather mild pattern \nsetting up.  The sub-tropical jet will remain quite amplified \nsending additional perturbations across the country.  Recent signal \nanalysis has trended stronger with a signal that is forecast to \ncross the region around 12/8-12/9 which could bring another round of \nshowers/storms to the region.  A subsequent signal has been trending \nstronger as well and that may arrive by 12/12-13th.",
